                <span begin="04:11.518" end="04:12.037">が</span>
                <span begin="04:12.037" end="04:12.917">あ</span>
                <span begin="04:12.917" end="04:13.525">る</span>
                <span begin="04:13.525" end="04:13.909">な</span>
                <span begin="04:13.909" end="04:14.933">ら</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果在一切终焉之时爱在此处</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </body>
</tt>
